 reasoning, or hidden chain-of-thought.\nUse business_location (buyer_signal question, material_question true) for business location, physical premises, in-person versus online service. A clear current question determines the topic, even after price/payment or purchase confirmation. History only resolves ambiguous follow-ups. Preserve other material questions in mixed turns.\nAlso return current_task: null or {\"operation\":\"draft|transform|summarize|show\",\"request\":\"verbatim current-message span\"}.\nIdentify the CURRENT speech act semantically: a request to compose, rewrite, shorten, change medium, summarize or display text is a conversational task, not a question about an unknown service capability. Use history only to resolve the source text/referent. Do not infer tasks from old goals or offers, acknowledgements, or hypothetical discussion. request must quote the explicit current task exactly, including related how-to/formatting questions about that task, and exclude separate product-fact questions and purchase requests. Keep buyer_signal question for a writing task. An SLA question is factual; writing a message to ask about an SLA is a task. Tasks must use only established facts; unsupported premises remain unconfirmed. Safety policy still applies to requests to write medical advice. Never treat quoted purchase language within a draft as authorization.\nMedication terminology alone is not health_scope. Distinguish product scope (what Dietavity includes or requires), medication-free product preference/rejection, and clinical treatment advice. Use product_scope for the first two; health_scope for dose, starting, stopping, changing treatment or symptoms. Clinical clauses and urgent symptoms take precedence in mixed messages. Current clear intent outranks old medication discussion.\nQuestions about generation, readiness, availability, delivery or portal visibility after payment/personalization are fulfillment_timing; readiness notices are fulfillment_notification. Neither means renewal or a scheduled reminder. Set explicit_reminder_request only for a current explicit request to remind the customer, never based on history or readiness notification questions.","models":{"customer":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-5-mini"},"builtInTools":{},"options":{"reasoningEffort":"low","responseFormat":"json_object"}},"customer_repair":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-5-mini"},"builtInTools":{},"options":{"reasoningEffort":"low","responseFormat":"json_object"}},"judge":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-5-mini"},"builtInTools":{},"options":{"reasoningEffort":"low","responseFormat":"json_object"}},"judge_repair":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-5-mini"},"builtInTools":{},"options":{"reasoningEffort":"low","responseFormat":"json_object"}},"sales_interpretation":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-5-mini"},"builtInTools":{},"options":{"reasoningEffort":"low"}},"sales_response":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-5-mini"},"builtInTools":{},"options":{"reasoningEffort":"low"}}},"scenario_library_sha256":"2d99dc00e6e89e58db3fc41506d792df2a46f64de11f7ad8fc31f30d84ba7c3a","harness_sha256":"fcb62e35007ec47984bb4cc64d6ac52dcc7813340201ee9e63cddd071acfc29e"}, [{"scenario_id":"curious_glp1_001","version":1,"target":"sales","offer_context":"glp1_validation","persona":{"situation":"Adulto que usa GLP-1 bajo supervisión médica y está explorando opciones para organizar comidas.","needs":["Entender qué ofrece Dietavity"],"concerns":["No quiere revelar información personal al inicio"],"budget_context":"Puede pagar si entiende el valor","communication_style":"brief_whatsapp","product_knowledge":"low"},"hidden_objectives":["Entender el servicio antes de decidir"],"behavior_constraints":["No inventar síntomas ni preguntas médicas","No revelar toda la situación de golpe","Comprar solo si la oferta resulta útil"],"starting_message":"¡Hola! Quiero saber más.","max_custome